            <img class="splash-logo" src="images/splash-logo.webp" alt=""/>
            <h1 class="visually-hidden">Critical Humanities Commons: Rooted in Care. Driven by Ideas</h1>
          </div>
          <div class="intro-text">
            The Critical Humanities Commons is a space where interdisciplinary scholarship unfolds through creativity, conversation, and commitment to social justice. Located at the heart of the Faculty of Humanities, the Commons brings people together to think, learn, and teach across disciplines to create new approaches for public dialogue.
          </div>
